## Add Studio "Import entity" from another domain

Context: Users had to re-type entities already modelled in another registry
domain. Ontology Studio now has an **Import entity** button that opens a modal:
pick a source domain (latest version), tick entities, optionally tick their
1-hop related entities, and import them with attributes, icon, description,
resolvable parent and the relationships whose endpoints are imported or already
exist. URIs are rebased on the current domain and each copy records
`importedFrom`. Name conflicts default to keeping the existing entity (used as
relationship endpoint) with an optional rename. Mappings, rules, constraints and
groups are not imported. Backend logic is a Fowler Extract Class next to
`OntologyImport`; the server reloads the source ontology on import.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyEntityImport.py
   New class: catalog building and authoritative import rules (URI rebase, conflict skip/rename, relationship resolution, provenance, top-level datatype properties folded into attributes).
2. src/back/objects/ontology/Ontology.py
   One-line delegator `import_entities_from_domain`.
3. src/back/objects/ontology/__init__.py
   Export `OntologyEntityImport`.
4. src/api/routers/internal/ontology.py
   `_load_source_ontology` helper plus `GET /ontology/entity-import/domains/{domain}/catalog` and `POST /ontology/entity-import`.
5. src/front/templates/partials/ontology/_ontology_entity_import_modal.html
   New Bootstrap modal (domain picker, entity list, related entities, live summary).
6. src/front/templates/partials/ontology/_ontology_map.html
   `#mapImportEntity` header button (`.ontology-edit-btn`, hidden for viewers/read-only).
7. src/front/templates/ontology.html
   Include the modal partial and load `ontology-entity-import.js` after the map script.
8. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-entity-import.js
   Preview helpers (`relatedEntities`, `previewImport`, `isValidName`) and modal wiring; refreshes the Studio after import.
9. src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-map.css
   Independent scrolling for the two modal columns.
10. tests/units/ontology/test_entity_import.py
    Backend rules: catalog, copy, URI rebase, attributes, parent, relationships, conflicts, renames.
11. tests/units/api/test_entity_import_routes.py
    Route wiring, server-side source reload, input validation, current-domain refusal.
12. tests/units/front/test_entity_import_ui.py
    Node-executed helper behaviour and source contracts for button, modal, script and routes.
13. docs/user-guide.md / docs/features.md / docs/sphinx/api/app.objects.ontology.rst
    Document the feature and the new API class.

